  "rows": {
    "900.2.10(5)": {
      "explanation": "Exception R 5 limits dwelling units to detached houses, semi-detached houses and duplexes. A duplex may be attached to one duplex on the neighbouring lot, and a duplex (or the outside of a pair of attached duplexes) needs a side yard setback of at least 3.0 m. A raised deck or platform in the front or rear yard may not extend into the required setback. No older by-laws prevail here.",
